  "description": "A simple and light WebSocket client.\nCan be set to ignore SSL/TLS server certificate issues (use with care!).\nEasily and effectively observe incoming message using Reactive Extensions (Rx)",
  "iconFile": "images\\1iveowl-logo.png",
